# Mutation plan for GET /api/v4/system/support_packet past its licence gate, the goccy YAML
# emitter it writes with, and `GenerateSupportData` (docs/PLUGIN_PLAN.md, Phase 5).
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/support-packet.plan
#
# The oracles: `mm_model::goyaml`'s and `support_packet`'s go_parity corpora (unit), the
# `parity::support_packet` suite against the licensed Go oracle, and the support-packet tranche of
# `parity::plugin_hooks`. The last two lines are the no-op controls and must SURVIVE.

